OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary to ban the Drumcree
OL,4,Aparade
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris said the chief constable
OL,7,Fadvised him "it would not be possible
OL,8,Fto enable the procession to happen
OL,9,Fwithout a major intervention which
OL,10,Fwould carry an unacceptable risk of
OL,11,Fserious injury, disorder and a wider
OL,12,Fcontagion effect across Northern
OL,13,FIreland".
OL,15,FHis decision has been welcomed by Sinn
OL,16,FFein and the SDLP, but DUP leader Gavin
OL,17,FRobinson said he now needs to "explain
OL,18,Fwhat his government intends to do to
OL,19,Frestore confidence in the rule of law".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
